<title>USA: Mid-America plans stock purchase plan.</title>
<headline>Mid-America plans stock purchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mid-America Apartment Communities Inc said on Friday its board approved a dividend reinvestment and direct stock purchase plan of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The company said that details of the plan should be finalized shortly and that it intends for the plan to take effect with the fourth quarter dividend payable January 31.</p>
<p>The company also said it expects third quarter operating expenses to be higher than the second quarter, partly due to seasonal effects and partly due to increased leasing activity.</p>
<p>It said it had achieved 98.1 percent occupancy at Oct 1, 1996, up from 96.9 percent a year ago.</p>
<p>Third quarter earnings will be released on October 31, the company said.</p>
